      "review_description": "I was very pleased with the entire service.The installation went very smoothly, and within two days of applying for the government subsidy, I had a brand new heat pump fully installed.Work was quick and efficient, and the site was left clean. I was alerted in advance of the work being done.My electricity from solar will now be used instead of gas. I am very pleased to know that I will make a substantial saving by swapping to electricity.But, I must thank Kieran for his awesome support. As a total stress head, particularly using my phone and laptop to fill in required forms, can I just say that Kieran was kind and so patient, giving me time to complete each step. Not an easy or quick task!The best phone support person ever! I hope Carbon Savers realise what an asset they have in you!Thank you to the entire team. Speaking of carbon - if we could carbon copy this fine level of service- what a pleasure it would be.Jan",
